+When a prepared octree leaf exhausts the existing refinement criteria, a bounded hard signed-box expression may use a complete rectilinear construction. It retains every original min/max occurrence and ancestor path, enumerates all open strata cut by exact represented box endpoints and actual leaf boundaries, and classifies signs without midpoint sampling. Every exposed rectangle is triangulated; zero-only sheets/edges/points and nonmanifold contacts remain explicit uncertainty. The construction can recover multiple sheets, closed internal components and cavities inside one existing cell.
